# An allowlist: the build gets only what it needs, so nothing else in the
# working tree (secrets, local databases, real health data, editor files)
# can reach an image layer, not even an intermediate one.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!api/
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/

# Within the allowed directories: dependencies are installed and the web
# app is built inside the image, and no data or secrets go in.
**/node_modules
internal/webui/dist
web/codegen
web/coverage
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.test
**/coverage.out
